# Xbox Controller Button List
# name        id    type     bitmask    axis_min axis_max

A             0     button   0x0001     -         -
B             1     button   0x0002     -         -
X             2     button   0x0004     -         -
Y             3     button   0x0008     -         -

LB            4     button   0x0010     -         -
RB            5     button   0x0020     -         -

BACK          6     button   0x0040     -         -
START         7     button   0x0080     -         -
GUIDE         8     button   0x0100     -         -

LSTICK_PRESS  9     button   0x0200     -         -
RSTICK_PRESS 10     button   0x0400     -         -

DPAD_UP      11     button   0x0800     -         -
DPAD_DOWN    12     button   0x1000     -         -
DPAD_LEFT    13     button   0x2000     -         -
DPAD_RIGHT   14     button   0x4000     -         -

LT           15     axis     -          0         255
RT           16     axis     -          0         255

LSTICK_X     17     axis     -         -32768    32767
LSTICK_Y     18     axis     -         -32768    32767
RSTICK_X     19     axis     -         -32768    32767
RSTICK_Y     20     axis     -         -32768    32767
